n    right: 18px;\n    bottom: 9px;\n    z-index: 6;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.94);\n    font: 13px/18px sans-serif;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <section class=\"entry e1\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《咏鹅》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了作者对于白鹅的喜爱赞美之情</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e2\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《江南》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了诗人对江南的[?]景热爱，也激发出着读者对<br>那美丽风光的向往</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e3\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《画》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了诗人对画中美景事物的欣赏和对大自然的热爱</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e4\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《悯农》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了作者对农夫辛勤劳作的赞美之情，同时也表<br>达出了作者对农夫的同情。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e5\">\n    <div class=\"title long-title\">《夜宿山寺》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了作者对儿童的天真烂漫，及他们丰富的想象力<br>的喜爱之情。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e6\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《风》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了诗人对大自然的热爱之情</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e7\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《春晓》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了诗人对春天的热爱和怜惜之情，寄托了诗人<br>热爱春天，珍惜春光的思想感情。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e8\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《赠汪伦》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了李白对汪伦的深厚情谊。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e9\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《静夜思》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了诗人夜晚难眠的所思及思念家乡的思想感情。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e10\">\n    <div class=\"title long-title\">《寻隐者不遇》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了作者对隐者生活的向往之情，并展示了他追求自<br>由自在的生活和淡泊名利的心境。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e11\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《池上》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了诗人对诗中小娃的天真幼稚、活泼淘气的<br>形象的喜爱，以及对田园生活的赞美之情。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e12\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《小池》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了作者对大自然景物的喜爱之情</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e13\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《画鸡》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了作者对雄鸡庄严威武的赞美之情</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e14\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《梅花》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达出梅花在百花凋谢的严冬，说明坚强高洁的性格<br>所具有的伟大魅力。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e15\">\n    <div class=\"title long-title\">《小儿垂钓》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表达了作者对孩童的喜爱之情，也表达了对于小孩<br>认真态度的敬佩之情。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry e16\">\n    <div class=\"title long-title\">《登鹳雀楼》</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">表现出诗人积极昂扬的抱负，表达了诗人昂扬向上<br>的进取精神。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark-icon\">小红书</div>\n  <div class=\"watermark\">小红书号: 4130673107</div>\n  <div class=\"bottom-edge\"></div>\n  <div class=\"book-edge\"></div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
